## Objectos ##

<div class="col75p example terminal">
&lt;form>
  &lt;input <span class=focus>name=a value=1</span> size=2> +
  &lt;input <span class=focus>name=b value=1</span> size=2>
  &lt;input type=button value="="  onclick="
     this.form.c.value = 
       parseInt(this.form.a.value) + 
       parseInt(this.form.b.value);"> 
  &lt;input <span class=focus>name=c</span> size=2>
  &lt;/form>
</div>
<div class=col25p style="margin-top: 100px;">
<form>

<input name=a value=1 size=2> +
<input name=b value=1 size=2>
<input type=button value="="onclick="
   this.form.c.value = 
   parseInt(this.form.a.value) + 
   parseInt(this.form.b.value);"> 
<input name=c size=2>

</form>
</div>


* Objetos de formulários <span class=litle>(<i>widgets</i>)</span> de vários tipos
    * <code class=focus>input</code>
    * <code class=focus>select</code>
    * <code class=focus>textarea</code>
* Cada objeto pode ter os atributos 
    * <code class=focus>name</code> nome pelo que é referido
    * <code class=focus>value</code> valor corrente